items/thm-reals-ordered-field.md:35:
items/thm-reals-ordered-field.md:36:The relation of [[def-real-order]] is well defined and makes $\mathbb{R}$
items/thm-reals-ordered-field.md:37:([[thm-reals-field]]) a totally ordered field.
